<InfoPage title="Contact" kicker="Corrections and privacy" description="How to reach the independent ClothOff AI editorial team about factual corrections, source updates, privacy, or rights concerns.">
  <h2>What to include</h2>
  <p>For the fastest review, include the page URL, the exact sentence or asset involved, the reason it should be corrected or removed, and a primary source that supports the request.</p>
  <h2>Do not send sensitive images</h2>
  <p>This publication does not need your personal photos, AI prompts, identification documents, or intimate material to evaluate an editorial request. Describe the concern in text and share only the minimum information necessary.</p>
  <h2>Current contact route</h2>
  <p>The planned editorial contact address is <a href="mailto:support@clothoffai.fun">support@clothoffai.fun</a>. Mail reception has not yet been configured, so delivery is not currently guaranteed. Please do not send sensitive images or personal information until that service is confirmed.</p>
</InfoPage>
